{"step_index":154,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T15:55:49Z","content":"{{ CHECKPOINT 2 }}\n **The earlier parts of this conversation have been truncated due to its long length. The following content summarizes the truncated context so that you may continue your work. **\n\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. 你覺得如果把這全部的內容打包成一個簡易的網站．\n是不是個不錯的想法？之後我還可以用同一個網站直接發給客戶介紹？\n2. 以下幾點優化：\n將＂目錄中＂的每個大類分別做成＂快捷按鈕＂可以直接引導到頁面的區段\n並且做成半隱藏式頁面．客戶要看完成的要點開才可以看到完整內容說明\n先完成這一步\n每一段的內容的樣式我們再來慢慢優化調整\n\n\n3. 我們來一個一個修正\n　１．產品介紹：　\n　　　－將原廠背書連結移除．改成參考原廠說明連結：https://www.jetbrains.com/business/#lean-in\n　　　－模型選擇：在JetBrains AI Assistant 平台改為＂可調用Claude ／GPT／Gemini 切換\n\n　２．產品優勢：\n　　　－將原廠說明連結中的：\rSmart Chat & Debugging Docs 連結變更為：\nhttps://www.jetbrains.com/help/ai-assistant/ai-chat.html\n\n　３．計費與模型優勢\n　　　－原廠條款背書中的：AI Service Agreement連結替換成以下連結：\nhttps://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/terms/jetbrains-ai-service/\n\n　４．帳務管理優勢\n　　　－將原廠文件背書中的：JetBrains Account Console Doc替換為：\nhttps://www.jetbrains.com/help/jetbrains-console/about-jetbrains-console.html\n　　　－AI CREDITS TERMS替換為以下的連結：\nhttps://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/terms/jetbrains-ai-credits/1.0/\n\n　５．第六段在地服務\n　　　－做成兩個部分\n<truncated 239 bytes>\n4. 在提供以下幾點優化：\n　1.畫面左上角的LOGO 幫我替換成附件這兩個並列．但是凍結列的設計不要變更\n\n第一段：產品簡介：\n　　－是否可以在卡片最下面預覽一段jetbrains \n<truncated 12075 bytes>\ned: 2026-08-31T14:52:01Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: jetbrains_ai_assistant_presentation]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1/jetbrains_ai_assistant_presentation.html\nLast Edited: 2026-08-31T14:53:33Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: logo-white]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1/logo-white.png\nLast Edited: 2026-08-31T15:52:50Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: hosting.cHVibGlj]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1/scratch/JetBrains-AI-Assistant-Portal/