{"step_index":161,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T15:59:02Z","thinking":"**Addressing the Blocked Navigation**\n\nI'm considering how to address the navigation issue where the target section is obstructed by a frozen row upon clicking the quick buttons. It seems impossible to perfectly align the target section at the very top. I'm exploring potential adjustments to improve visibility, perhaps by offsetting the navigation slightly.\n\n\n**Refining the Scroll Adjustment**\n\nI've homed in on the sticky navigation obscuring target sections. The image provided clearly demonstrates the issue. To remedy this, I am now focused on implementing `scroll-margin-top` in CSS across all section cards, with an initial offset of ~200px based on the navbar and directory header heights. This value will be refined after testing, to ensure that the section titles land perfectly below the sticky navigation. I'll need to modify the Javascript `navigateToSection` to account for this new offset or use the `scroll-margin-top`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"修正 Portal 網站捲動遮擋問題：加入 scroll-margin-top (210px) 偏移量，確保點擊快捷按鈕與右側選單導航時，區塊標題完美對齊於頂部凍結列下方，不再被遮擋。\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"zh-TW\\\" class=\\\"scroll-smooth\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\">\\n  <title>JetBrains AI Assistant 企業級開發助手 - 迪凱科技 AHASoft</title>\\n  <script src=\\\"https://www.gstatic.com/antigravity/web/dev/tailwindcss.min.js\\\"></script>\\n  <style>\\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap');\\n    body {\\n      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\\n    }\\n    .accordion-content {\\n      transition: max-height 0.4s ease, opacity 0.4s ease;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n    }\\n    .accordion-closed {\\n      max-height: 0 !important;\\n      opacity: 0;\\n      padding-top: 0 !important;\\n      padding-bottom: 0 !important;\\n      margin-top: 0 !important;\\n      pointer-events: none;\\n    }\\n    .accordion-open {\\n      max-height: 4000px !important;\\n      opacity: 1;\\n    }\\n    .text-glow {\\n      text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.7);\\n    }\\n    /* 設定全區段導航捲動頂部預留偏移量 (避免被 fixed/sticky 凍結列遮擋) */\\n    section[id^=\\\"sec-\\\"] {\\n      scroll-margin-top: 220px;\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body class=\\\"bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 antialiased selection:bg-indigo-500 selection:text-white\\\">\\n\\n  <!-- Navigation Bar (頂部凍結列) -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-800/80\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-20 flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n      \\n      <!-- LOGO 白 + 品牌文字標題區 -->\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n        <!-- JetBrains LOGO 白 圖片 -->\\n        <img src=\\\"logo-white.png\\\" alt=\\\"JetBrains White Logo\\\" class=\\\"h-10 sm:h-12 w-auto object-contain bg-slate-950 rounded-lg p-1 border border-slate-800 shadow-md\\\">\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"border-l-2 border-slate-800 pl-4\\\">\\n   \n<truncated 50499 bytes>","Description":"\"修正 dekai_jetbrains_ai_portal.html：設定 scroll-margin-top: 220px，確保點擊快捷按鈕捲動定位時，區塊標題卡片精準對齊於凍結列下方，不被遮擋。\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\User\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1/dekai_jetbrains_ai_portal.html\"","toolAction":"\"Updating local portal with scroll-margin-top offset fix\"","toolSummary":"\"Update local portal HTML with scroll-margin-top offset fix\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
