{"step_index":177,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T16:10:42Z","thinking":"**Considering Cache Removal**\n\nI'm currently mulling over the user's request. Removing the cache entirely seems a bit drastic, impacting performance. An \"auto-refresh\" button or an easy way to clear the cache for troubleshooting seems like a good solution. The main goal is to minimize disruption while allowing a solution for the occasional caching problem.\n\n\n**Analyzing Cache Strategy**\n\nI've been digging into the core issue: aggressive browser caching, and Firebase Hosting's defaults. It's clear that caching is essential for speed, but the user's issue highlights its potential to cause outdated content. I'm focusing on elegant solutions. Specifically, I'm analyzing the `firebase.json` configuration options for `Cache-Control` headers, considering `no-cache`, `no-store`, and `must-revalidate` directives to address the HTML caching challenge. This looks like a powerful and fundamental option.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Anti-Caching Solutions**\n\nI'm now comparing several anti-caching methods. Completely preventing HTML caching seems ideal for instant updates. I am evaluating meta tags, a simple \"Force Reload\" button for users, and the elegant but comprehensive firebase.json configuration for `Cache-Control`. The firebase.json modification appears most fundamental, while the others provide good secondary options. I'm leaning toward a combination of strategies, where I configure the `firebase.json` file to address caching fundamentally, and add a discrete cache-buster button for quick updates. I'm focusing on user transparency and performance optimization.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"設定 Firebase Hosting 無快取 (no-cache) 標頭，防止客戶瀏覽器卡暫存。\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"{\\n  \\\"hosting\\\": {\\n    \\\"public\\\": \\\"public\\\",\\n    \\\"ignore\\\": [\\n      \\\"firebase.json\\\",\\n      \\\"**/.*\\\",\\n      \\\"**/node_modules/**\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"headers\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"source\\\": \\\"**\\\",\\n        \\\"headers\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"key\\\": \\\"Cache-Control\\\",\\n            \\\"value\\\": \\\"no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate, max-age=0\\\"\\n          },\\n          {\\n            \\\"key\\\": \\\"Pragma\\\",\\n            \\\"value\\\": \\\"no-cache\\\"\\n          },\\n          {\\n            \\\"key\\\": \\\"Expires\\\",\\n            \\\"value\\\": \\\"0\\\"\\n          }\\n        ]\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"rewrites\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"source\\\": \\\"**\\\",\\n        \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/index.html\\\"\\n      }\\n    ]\\n  }\\n}\\n\"","Description":"\"設定 firebase.json 加入 Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate 標頭，徹底解決瀏覽器與 CDN 快取舊版本的問題。\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\User\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1\\\\scratch\\\\JetBrains-AI-Assistant-Portal\\\\firebase.json\"","toolAction":"\"Configuring Firebase Hosting Cache-Control headers for anti-caching\"","toolSummary":"\"Configure Firebase Hosting Cache-Control headers\""}}]}
